[ti:PyTorch 2.12: Faster Math, Unified Graphs, and Wider Hardware Support]
[ar:Ava & Brian]
[al:PyTorch Blog Podcast]
[00:00.00]Ava: If your training job spends minutes solving lots of small eigenvalue problems, PyTorch 2.
[00:00.00]Ava：如果训练任务要花几分钟求解大量小型特征值问题，PyTorch 2.
[00:06.67]12 may change that to seconds.
[00:06.67]12 版可能把耗时缩短到几秒。
[00:08.92]And the headline number is up to one hundred times faster on CUDA.
[00:08.92]最亮眼的数字是：在 CUDA 上最高提速 100 倍。
[00:14.22]Brian: Right. This release is also about making PyTorch feel more consistent across hardware.
[00:14.22]Brian：对。这次发布也让 PyTorch 在不同硬件上的体验更一致。
[00:20.99]We get a device-agnostic graph API, wider export support, and several distributed and ROCm improvements.
[00:20.99]新增了设备无关的图 API，扩大了导出支持，还改进了分布式功能和 ROCm。
[00:29.52]Ava: So let's start with the speed story. What exactly changed for batched linalg. eigh?
[00:29.52]Ava：先说性能。批量 linalg.eigh 究竟改了什么？
[00:36.26]Brian: linalg. eigh computes eigenvalues and eigenvectors for symmetric or Hermitian matrices.
[00:36.26]Brian：linalg.eigh 用于计算对称矩阵或厄米矩阵的特征值和特征向量。
[00:42.43]In earlier releases, the CUDA path could dispatch each matrix solve separately.
[00:42.43]此前的版本中，CUDA 路径可能会逐个分派矩阵求解任务。
[00:48.04]That created a big performance gap, especially when you had many small or medium matrices.
[00:48.04]这造成了很大的性能差距，处理大量小型或中型矩阵时尤其明显。
[00:54.78]Ava: So the GPU was doing lots of tiny jobs instead of one big batch?
[00:54.78]Ava：所以 GPU 当时在执行许多小任务，而不是一次处理整个批次？
[00:59.97]Brian: Exactly. PyTorch has overhauled backend selection.
[00:59.97]Brian：正是如此。PyTorch 全面调整了后端选择方式。
[01:03.69]The old MAGMA backend was deprecated in favor of cuSolver, and the dispatch heuristics now use cuSolver's syevj_batched kernel unconditionally for this case.
[01:03.69]旧的 MAGMA 后端已弃用，改用 cuSolver；现在对此类任务，调度逻辑始终使用 cuSolver 的 syevj_batched 内核。
[01:15.71]Ava: And that kernel is designed for many matrices at once.
[01:15.71]Ava：这个内核就是为同时处理多个矩阵设计的。
[01:20.26]Brian: Yes. It processes the batch as a single GPU operation.
[01:20.26]Brian：对。它把整个批次作为一次 GPU 操作来处理。
[01:23.97]The article says workloads that used to take minutes can now run in seconds, with speedups of up to one hundred times over the previous release.
[01:23.97]文章说，原本要跑几分钟的任务现在几秒就能完成，比上一版本最高快 100 倍。
[01:34.22]Ava: That sounds huge, but the wording matters: up to one hundred times, not every workload.
[01:34.22]Ava：听起来提升很大，但要注意是“最高 100 倍”，并非所有任务都如此。
[01:41.00]Brian: Correct. The gain depends on the workload.
[01:41.00]Brian：没错，提升幅度取决于具体任务。
[01:44.03]The release calls out scientific computing and machine learning jobs that rely on batched eigendecompositions.
[01:44.03]发布说明特别提到了依赖批量特征分解的科学计算和机器学习任务。
[01:51.96]It also says this helps close longstanding performance gaps with CuPy.
[01:51.96]它还说，这有助于缩小与 CuPy 长期存在的性能差距。
[01:57.36]Ava: Let's move to optimizers. Adagrad now has fused equals true. What does fused mean here?
[01:57.36]Ava：再说优化器。Adagrad 现在支持 fused=True。这里的 fused 是什么意思？
[02:05.03]Brian: A fused optimizer performs the whole optimizer step in one CUDA kernel.
[02:05.03]Brian：融合优化器用一个 CUDA 内核完成整个优化步骤。
[02:10.75]Without fusion, separate operations launch separate kernels.
[02:10.75]如果不融合，各项操作就要分别启动内核。
[02:15.58]Fusion reduces kernel launch overhead and memory traffic.
[02:15.58]融合能减少内核启动开销和内存数据传输。
[02:20.52]Ava: So Adagrad joins Adam, AdamW, and SGD in having a fused variant.
[02:20.52]Ava：这样 Adagrad 也和 Adam、AdamW、SGD 一样，有了融合版本。
[02:27.78]Brian: Exactly. The CUDA kernel was contributed during the 2.
[02:27.78]Brian：没错。CUDA 内核是在 2.
[02:32.20]11 cycle, and the Python frontend is now exposed in 2. 12.
[02:32.20]11 开发周期贡献的，Python 前端现已在 2.12 中开放。
[02:36.94]The practical idea is simple: fewer launches and less movement of intermediate data.
[02:36.94]实际思路很简单：减少内核启动次数和中间数据搬运。
[02:44.16]Ava: Now, the bigger architectural change seems to be torch. accelerator. Graph.
[02:44.16]Ava：接下来，更大的架构变化似乎是 torch.accelerator.Graph。
[02:49.91]Brian: Yes. torch. accelerator.
[02:49.91]Brian：对，torch.accelerator.
[02:51.88]Graph is a new device-agnostic API for graph capture and replay.
[02:51.88]Graph 是用于图捕获和重放的新设备无关 API。
[02:57.14]Instead of users learning a separate graph interface for every backend, they get one common abstraction.
[02:57.14]用户不必为每种后端学习不同的图接口，可以使用统一的抽象接口。
[03:06.03]Ava: Can you give a plain-language analogy?
[03:06.03]Ava：能用通俗的话打个比方吗？
[03:08.61]Brian: Think of recording a fixed sequence of GPU work and replaying that recording many times.
[03:08.61]Brian：就像录下一套固定的 GPU 操作，再反复播放。
[03:15.15]The API is like a universal remote.
[03:15.15]这个 API 就像一只万能遥控器。
[03:17.75]CUDA, XPU, and out-of-tree backends can keep their own internal implementations, but users interact with a consistent control surface.
[03:17.75]CUDA、XPU 和源码树外后端仍可保留各自的内部实现，但用户使用的是一致的接口。
[03:28.04]Ava: How do backends plug into it?
[03:28.04]Ava：后端怎么接入？
[03:30.72]Brian: Each backend can register an implementation through GraphImplInterface.
[03:30.72]Brian：各后端可以通过 GraphImplInterface 注册自己的实现。
[03:35.93]That keeps backend autonomy while giving applications a shared API.
[03:35.93]这样后端仍能自主实现，应用则可以使用统一的 API。
[03:40.84]The release has initial XPU support and an extension path for out-of-tree backends through PrivateUse1.
[03:40.84]此版本初步支持 XPU，也为源码树外后端提供了通过 PrivateUse1 扩展的途径。
[03:48.74]Ava: There is also a stream change, right?
[03:48.74]Ava：流方面也有变化，对吧？
[03:51.73]Brian: Right. c10d::Stream and torch.
[03:51.73]Brian：对。c10d::Stream 和 torch.
[03:54.42]Stream now expose is_capturing(), which replaces the device-specific is_current_stream_capturing.
[03:54.42]Stream 现在提供 is_capturing()，取代设备专用的 is_current_stream_capturing。
[04:03.12]Stream context manager reentrance was fixed too.
[04:03.12]Stream 上下文管理器的重入问题也修复了。
[04:07.43]Together, these changes improve parity across backends.
[04:07.43]这些改动共同提升了各后端的一致性。
[04:12.72]Ava: What about export and quantization?
[04:12.72]Ava：导出和量化方面呢？
[04:15.85]Brian: torch. export. save and torch. export.
[04:15.85]Brian：torch.export.save 和 torch.export.
[04:19.99]load now support Microscaling, or MX, quantization formats. Before 2.
[04:19.99]load 现在支持微缩放（MX）量化格式。在 2.
[04:27.50]12, export could not handle the float8_e8m0fnu dtype used as the shared block-scale exponent in MXFP4, MXFP6, and MXFP8.
[04:27.50]12 之前，导出功能无法处理 float8_e8m0fnu 数据类型；它在 MXFP4、MXFP6 和 MXFP8 中用作共享的块缩放指数。
[04:40.92]Ava: So a model could use MX quantization, but the export-to-deployment path was blocked.
[04:40.92]Ava：也就是说，模型可以使用 MX 量化，却无法顺利导出并部署。
[04:47.32]Brian: Exactly. Now tensors with that dtype can be serialized and deserialized correctly.
[04:47.32]Brian：没错。现在这种数据类型的张量可以正确序列化和反序列化了。
[04:52.90]That unblocks the full workflow for aggressively compressed models, which matters for large language models deployed in cost-constrained or edge environments.
[04:52.90]这打通了高度压缩模型的完整工作流程，对部署在成本受限或边缘环境中的大语言模型尤其重要。
[05:04.01]Ava: That is a nice example of a small missing dtype support causing a much larger production problem.
[05:04.01]Ava：这很能说明问题：只缺少一种 dtype 支持，就可能引发严重得多的生产问题。
[05:10.79]Brian: Yes. The quantization method existed, but the deployment handoff was incomplete.
[05:10.79]Brian：是的。量化方法已经有了，但部署环节还没打通。
[05:17.45]This release closes that gap.
[05:17.45]这个版本补上了这一环。
[05:20.22]Ava: The release also mentions torch. cond inside CUDA Graphs. Why was that difficult?
[05:20.22]Ava：这个版本还提到了 CUDA Graphs 中的 torch.cond。之前难在哪里？
[05:27.02]Brian: torch. cond represents data-dependent control flow.
[05:27.02]Brian：torch.cond 表示依赖数据的控制流。
[05:30.84]Previously, branches were evaluated on the CPU, so CUDA graph capture had to fall back to CUDA graph trees.
[05:30.84]以前分支在 CPU 上求值，因此 CUDA 图捕获必须回退到 CUDA Graph Trees。
[05:38.84]With CUDA 12.
[05:38.84]有了 CUDA 12.
[05:39.81]4 conditional IF nodes, both branches can now be evaluated on the GPU inside one graph capture.
[05:39.81]4 的条件 IF 节点，现在可以在 GPU 上的一次图捕获中对两个分支求值。
[05:47.27]Ava: So the graph can contain the decision itself.
[05:47.27]Ava：也就是说，图里可以包含决策本身。
[05:50.91]Brian: Exactly. It can capture and replay the control-flow region.
[05:50.91]Brian：没错。它能捕获并重放这段控制流。
[05:55.13]The current support works with the eager and cudagraphs backends.
[05:55.13]目前 eager 和 cudagraphs 后端支持这一功能。
[05:59.79]Inductor support is planned for a future release, so that is one limitation to remember.
[05:59.79]Inductor 支持计划在未来版本加入，这是一个需要留意的限制。
[06:06.45]Ava: There is also a numerical correctness update for XPU involving addcdiv.
[06:06.45]Ava：XPU 的 addcdiv 还有一项数值正确性更新。
[06:12.17]Brian: Yes.
[06:12.17]Brian：是的。
[06:12.52]addcdiv is a fused arithmetic operation: input plus value times tensor one divided by tensor two.
[06:12.52]addcdiv 是一种融合算术运算：输入加上 value 乘以张量一，再除以张量二。
[06:21.02]It appears in optimizer update rules such as Adam, AdamW, and RMSprop.
[06:21.02]它用于 Adam、AdamW 和 RMSprop 等优化器的更新规则。
[06:27.50]Ava: What was going wrong?
[06:27.50]Ava：之前出了什么问题？
[06:29.43]Brian: Inductor previously lowered the operation with separate multiply and divide instructions.
[06:29.43]Brian：以前 Inductor 会把这个运算拆成单独的乘法和除法指令。
[06:35.44]That could create small floating-point rounding differences compared with eager CUDA execution.
[06:35.44]与 CUDA 的 eager 执行相比，这可能产生微小的浮点舍入差异。
[06:41.84]Over thousands of steps, those differences can accumulate.
[06:41.84]经过数千步，这些差异可能累积。
[06:46.10]Ava: And now it uses fused multiply-add instructions?
[06:46.10]Ava：现在改用融合乘加指令了？
[06:50.05]Brian: For CUDA first, and now for XPU as well.
[06:50.05]Brian：先支持了 CUDA，现在 XPU 也支持了。
[06:52.93]The goal is bitwise numerical parity with eager CUDA execution while preserving Triton kernel fusion benefits.
[06:52.93]目标是在保留 Triton 内核融合优势的同时，让数值结果与 CUDA 的 eager 执行逐位一致。
[07:00.85]That helps teams validate compiled optimizer-heavy training loops on NVIDIA and Intel hardware.
[07:00.85]这有助于团队在 NVIDIA 和 Intel 硬件上验证编译后的优化器密集型训练循环。
[07:08.04]Ava: Let's talk distributed training. What changed for custom operators?
[07:08.04]Ava：再谈谈分布式训练。自定义算子有什么变化？
[07:13.17]Brian: Custom operators can now accept ProcessGroup objects directly.
[07:13.17]Brian：自定义算子现在可以直接接收 ProcessGroup 对象。
[07:17.86]Callers no longer have to turn a group into a string name and look it up in a global registry.
[07:17.86]调用方不必再把进程组转成字符串名称，再从全局注册表中查找。
[07:24.97]The c10d functional collective operations, including all_reduce and reduce_scatter, accept both objects and string names.
[07:24.97]c10d 的函数式集合通信操作，包括 all_reduce 和 reduce_scatter，现在同时接受对象和字符串名称。
[07:34.47]Ava: That sounds like a cleaner interface.
[07:34.47]Ava：这个接口更简洁了。
[07:37.49]Brian: It is, and profiling got richer too.
[07:37.49]Brian：是的，性能分析信息也更丰富了。
[07:40.61]The PyTorch Profiler Events API now exposes flow IDs, flow types, activity types, unfinished events, and Python function events.
[07:40.61]PyTorch Profiler Events API 现在会提供流 ID、流类型、活动类型、未完成事件和 Python 函数事件。
[07:51.70]Its events() output is closer to the Chrome trace JSON output.
[07:51.70]它的 events() 输出也更接近 Chrome 跟踪记录的 JSON 输出。
[07:57.42]Ava: How does that help with multi-node debugging?
[07:57.42]Ava：这对多节点调试有什么帮助？
[08:00.72]Brian: NCCL collective traces can now be correlated across ranks with a seq_num field.
[08:00.72]Brian：现在可以通过 seq_num 字段关联不同 rank 上的 NCCL 集合通信跟踪记录。
[08:06.57]All ranks participating in the same collective share the same sequence number within a process group.
[08:06.57]同一进程组内参与同一次集合通信的所有 rank 都共享同一个序列号。
[08:14.04]That makes post-hoc analysis much more practical.
[08:14.04]这让事后分析实用得多。
[08:18.02]Ava: And FlightRecorder covers more communication backends.
[08:18.02]Ava：FlightRecorder 也覆盖了更多通信后端。
[08:22.64]Brian: Yes. Its trace analyzer now supports ncclx and gloo alongside nccl and xccl.
[08:22.64]Brian：是的。除了 nccl 和 xccl，它的跟踪分析器现在还支持 ncclx 和 gloo。
[08:29.65]It also recognizes torchcomms operations such as all_gather_single, reduce_scatter_v, and barrier.
[08:29.65]它也能识别 all_gather_single、reduce_scatter_v 和 barrier 等 torchcomms 操作。
[08:38.69]A race condition involving multiple process groups was fixed as well.
[08:38.69]此外还修复了涉及多个进程组的竞态问题。
[08:45.40]Ava: What platform updates should ROCm users notice?
[08:45.40]Ava：ROCm 用户该关注哪些平台更新？
[08:49.81]Brian: Several. On AMD GPUs with ROCm 7.
[08:49.81]Brian：有几项。在使用 ROCm 7. 的 AMD GPU 上，
[08:52.57]02 or newer, the caching allocator supports expandable memory segments.
[08:52.57]02 或更高版本的缓存分配器支持可扩展内存段。
[08:58.50]That dynamically grows allocations through virtual memory APIs and reduces fragmentation, matching the CUDA feature.
[08:58.50]它通过虚拟内存 API 动态扩展内存分配，减少碎片化，与 CUDA 的这项功能一致。
[09:08.54]Ava: There is also rocSHMEM.
[09:08.54]Ava：还有 rocSHMEM。
[09:11.85]Brian: Right. rocSHMEM brings symmetric memory collective operations to AMD GPUs through torch.
[09:11.85]Brian：对。rocSHMEM 通过 torch.
[09:19.38]ops. symm_mem.
[09:19.38]ops.symm_mem 为 AMD GPU 提供对称内存集合通信操作。
[09:20.58]It ports on-GPU primitives such as point-to-point, broadcast, all-to-all, and MoE-oriented two-dimensional AllToAllv.
[09:20.58]它移植了 GPU 上的点对点、广播、全对全，以及面向 MoE 的二维 AllToAllv 等原语。
[09:30.94]Ava: And sparse computation?
[09:30.94]Ava：稀疏计算呢？
[09:33.38]Brian: hipSPARSELt is enabled by default in ROCm builds at 7. 12 or newer.
[09:33.38]Brian：ROCm 7.12 及更新版本的构建默认启用 hipSPARSELt。
[09:40.24]It adds semi-structured two-to-four sparsity support, and FP8 inputs are supported on MI350X with FP32 output.
[09:40.24]它支持 2:4 半结构化稀疏；在 MI350X 上支持 FP8 输入和 FP32 输出。
[09:51.51]That enables the torch. _cslt_sparse_mm acceleration path on AMD.
[09:51.51]这让 AMD GPU 能使用 torch._cslt_sparse_mm 加速路径。
[09:58.52]Ava: FlexAttention also gets a pipeline change.
[09:58.52]Ava：FlexAttention 的流水线也有变化。
[10:02.71]Brian: Yes. On AMD GPUs, the Triton backend now uses two-stage pipelining for FlexAttention.
[10:02.71]Brian：对。AMD GPU 上的 Triton 后端现在为 FlexAttention 使用两阶段流水线。
[10:09.20]The article reports five to twenty-six percent speedups across causal, alibi, and sliding-window attention patterns on MI350X.
[10:09.20]文章称，在 MI350X 上，因果、ALiBi 和滑动窗口注意力模式提速 5% 至 26%。
[10:18.83]The change was just a one-line configuration adjustment from one stage to two.
[10:18.83]这次改动只用一行配置，就把阶段数从一改成了二。
[10:25.14]Ava: What about Apple users?
[10:25.14]Ava：苹果用户呢？
[10:27.34]Brian: Apple Silicon binary wheels now ship with ahead-of-time-compiled Metal-4 shaders.
[10:27.34]Brian：Apple Silicon 的二进制 wheel 现在附带预编译的 Metal 4 着色器。
[10:33.28]They were built on macOS 26 with the Metal-4 standard, so MPS workloads avoid runtime shader compilation on first run and get lower startup latency.
[10:33.28]它们基于 macOS 26 和 Metal 4 标准构建，让 MPS 工作负载首次运行时无需现场编译着色器，启动延迟也更低。
[10:44.49]Ava: Before we wrap up, we need the migration warnings.
[10:44.49]Ava：结束前，还得说说迁移注意事项。
[10:48.87]Brian: The biggest future change is torchcomms. In an upcoming release, 2.
[10:48.87]Brian：未来最大的变化是 torchcomms。PyTorch 计划在即将发布的 2.
[10:53.94]13 or later, PyTorch plans to use torchcomms by default in Distributed.
[10:53.94]13 或更新版本中，让分布式模块默认使用 torchcomms。
[10:59.30]That brings breaking changes to ProcessGroup behavior, even though the team aims to make most migrations automatic.
[10:59.30]这会对 ProcessGroup 行为带来不兼容变更，尽管团队希望让大部分迁移自动完成。
[11:08.35]Ava: What should engineers watch for?
[11:08.35]Ava：工程师要注意什么？
[11:10.93]Brian: ProcessGroups and communicators will need eager initialization during dist.
[11:10.93]Brian：ProcessGroup 和通信器需要在调用 dist.
[11:16.40]init_process_group, with one backend device.
[11:16.40]init_process_group 时提前初始化，并指定一个后端设备。
[11:19.61]P2P operations on the same group and stream will not be guaranteed to run concurrently; concurrent operations will need batch APIs or a separate group.
[11:19.61]同一组和流上的 P2P 操作不保证并发执行；并发操作需要使用批量 API 或单独的组。
[11:30.62]PyTorch also plans to make torchcomms a required package and deprecate the existing c10d backends.
[11:30.62]PyTorch 还计划将 torchcomms 设为必需依赖，并弃用现有的 c10d 后端。
[11:38.11]Ava: And TorchScript?
[11:38.11]Ava：那 TorchScript 呢？
[11:40.24]Brian: TorchScript is now deprecated. It was deprecated in 2. 10.
[11:40.24]Brian：TorchScript 已弃用，从 2.10 版开始就是如此。
[11:44.78]The recommended direction is torch.
[11:44.78]推荐改用 torch.
[11:47.52]export instead of the jit trace and script APIs, and Executorch instead of the embedded runtime.
[11:47.52]export 替代 jit 的 trace 和 script API，并用 ExecuTorch 替代嵌入式运行时。
[11:55.40]Ava: There is one more packaging detail: CUDA 12. 8 wheels.
[11:55.40]Ava：还有一个打包细节：CUDA 12.8 wheel。
[12:00.74]Brian: Starting with 2. 12, the CUDA 12.
[12:00.74]Brian：从 2.12 版开始，CUDA 12.
[12:03.59]8 binary wheel is deprecated and will no longer be in the standard release matrix.
[12:03.59]8 二进制 wheel 将被弃用，不再列入标准发布矩阵。
[12:10.68]The default wheel is CUDA 13. 0, CUDA 13. 2 is experimental, and CUDA 12.
[12:10.68]默认 wheel 使用 CUDA 13.0，CUDA 13.2 尚处实验阶段，而 CUDA 12.
[12:17.00]6 remains supported for older architectures. Newer GPUs need CUDA 13.
[12:17.00]6 仍支持较旧的架构。新款 GPU 需要 CUDA 13.
[12:22.97]0 or newer and an NVIDIA driver upgrade to the versions listed in the release notes.
